# THE `words` MAP (V51): compressed notation back to the plain words it
# abbreviates. OPT-IN -- nothing reads this file until a map line says
# `use words`, in a `.ctrm-map` or a `--map` flag.
#
# WHY OPT-IN, when the builtin map beside it is on by default: that map
# rewrites what a writer never chose (an editor's curly quote), so taking
# it away costs nothing. These symbols were typed ON PURPOSE and carry
# meaning, so rewriting them is a decision a project makes, never one this
# crate makes for it (`src/fix:V26` stays as it is).
#
# WHY IT EXISTS AT ALL, measured rather than assumed (`src/fix/words:R9`,
# `src/fix/words:R11`): o200k spends two or three tokens on each of the first
# few symbols below and one on the word, which makes this the one rewrite in the
# crate that buys tokens. Only o200k was measured; the Claude tokenizer was not.
#
# HOW AN ENTRY GOT IN: it costs no MORE tokens than the symbol, measured on 112
# caveman `SPEC*.md` files (`src/fix/words:R11`). Saved over that corpus, and
# the number of uses it was saved over, are on each line's comment.
#
# A `word` line keeps its word apart from a neighbouring letter or digit
# (V51), so `U+22A5owns` becomes `not owns` rather than `notowns`. The
# plain lines at the bottom need no such care: their replacements open
# and close with punctuation, which never fuses with a word.

# UP TACK, as in "does not own". 4817 saved over 2447 uses: ~2 each, the
# largest single saving the crate measures.
word U+22A5 not

# THEREFORE. 1366 over 1366 uses.
word U+2234 so

# BECAUSE. 359 over 359.
word U+2235 because

# FOR ALL. 332 over 354: a few uses sit where the word costs what the
# symbol did, and none where it costs more.
word U+2200 all

# ELEMENT OF. 36 over 36.
word U+2208 in

# THERE EXISTS. 21 over 21.
word U+2203 exists

# NOT EQUAL TO. 28 over 28.
U+2260 !=

# RIGHTWARDS ARROW and RIGHTWARDS DOUBLE ARROW, at PARITY: 0 saved over 1167 and
# 75 uses. Kept because they cost nothing and finish the job -- a file that
# opted into this map wants its notation in ASCII, and an arrow left behind
# would fail the same check. A project that wants its arrows grants them, and
# `fix` never touches a granted character (`src/fix:V6`).
U+2192 ->
U+21D2 =>
